Host stack of guest threads: --guest_thread_host_stack_kb, 4 MB on Switch instead of 16 MB. Horizon commits a
thread's stack whole, so MGR's mission loading ran out of memory creating threads (black screen). A failed
creation now logs process memory, the thread limit and the heap.

--- a/src/system/xthread.cpp
+++ b/src/system/xthread.cpp
